DESCRIPTION:From September 7 to 28\, expansive energy stirs the tension be
 tween your home life (house 4\, where your Venus sits) and how you show up
  with partners (house 7). You may feel pulled to grow\, spend\, or say yes
  to something involving a relationship\, but it touches your sense of comf
 ort and worth at home. This isn't a crisis — it's an invitation to expan
 d without abandoning your roots. Notice where you're tempted to overcommit
  for the sake of a partner or deal.\n→ Before saying yes to something bi
 g this month\, ask: does this also nourish my home and my own values?\n\n
 — Technical detail: Jupiter within orb of square your Venus natal (house
  4) · exact: 16/09/26\n\n(until Sep 28)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
