DESCRIPTION:This Full Moon lands in your house of money and self-worth\, o
 pposite your house of shared resources and deep transformation — the cla
 ssic tension between what's yours and what you share with others. Neptune 
 sits right on this Moon\, dissolving boundaries around what you think you'
 re worth\, maybe blurring a financial picture or an old insecurity. Mars\,
  ruler of this Moon and tied to your own hidden house 12\, has moved into 
 your partnership house — suggesting the resolution comes through an hone
 st\, even assertive conversation with someone close\, not through avoidanc
 e.\nThis Moon completes a cycle that began at the New Moon of April 17: wh
 at intention did you set then about your value or resources? Now you see t
 he real fruit of it — foggy or clear.\n→ Revisit what you intended in 
 April. What financial or self-worth story is ready to be released?\n\n— 
 Technical detail: Full Moon · 3°37' Aries · house 2 · exact 26/09 18:4
 9
