 ds\, then slips back into your house 9 territory of beliefs and growth unt
 il mid-November. This is a season to review how you relate to partners\, m
 oney you share with others\, and what you truly value — not to make big 
 new commitments. Old faces\, old desires\, or unfinished stories about wor
 th and pleasure may resurface. Avoid rushing into big purchases or declara
 tions of love\; instead\, reflect on what you've learned about closeness a
 nd self-worth since this journey began.\n→ What relationship pattern is 
 asking to be understood\, not repeated?\n\n— Technical detail: Venus ret
 rograde · 8°29' Scorpio → 22°51' Libra · house 9\n\n(until Nov 14)
